{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "ALL scoring knobs live here. lib/scoring/engine.ts hardcodes no weight, keyword, tier or bucket.",
    "This file is re-read and content-hashed on every scoring run; a hash change rescoring all listings.",
    "Every 'patterns' entry is a JavaScript regular-expression source string, compiled case-insensitively.",
    "Keep patterns word-boundary safe: \\bgo\\b must not match 'Google' or 'Chicago'."
